{
  "about": "Test cases whose bytes did not come from this repository's library. spec/vectors/v1.json is generated by that library, so a mistake in it would be in the vectors, the server and the conformance suite alike; these are derived apart from it, by spec/vectors/derive-independent.py, and independent.md says how. An implementation checks that it reproduces every byte here.",
